1
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,430
Which ones did it?

2
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:40,160
They are all felons.

3
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,940
They've all killed someone.

4
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,010
[Dearest Episode 18]

5
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:15,940
207, Wen Yanhui.

6
00:01:16,350 --> 00:01:18,230
Your bail application has been approved.

7
00:01:18,230 --> 00:01:20,039
Pack your personal belongings,
complete the formalities,

8
00:01:20,039 --> 00:01:21,300
and get ready to leave.

9
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:35,970
Look familiar?

10
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,330
What are you going to do?

11
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:39,200
You've used every single item here

12
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,070
on Mom.

13
00:01:43,390 --> 00:01:44,320
Do you like them?

14
00:01:45,789 --> 00:01:47,229
You two are crazy.

15
00:01:47,810 --> 00:01:50,289
I am the chairman of Wen Group!

16
00:01:50,310 --> 00:01:51,590
-I am your...
-Dad.

17
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,759
You really are sick.

18
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:03,730
Wen Group has nothing to do with you now.

19
00:02:03,830 --> 00:02:05,220
It's ours.

20
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,710
Come on, take your medicine.

21
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,600
Mom prepared it for you herself.

22
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:11,970
You refused to take it?

23
00:02:18,210 --> 00:02:20,240
I became the chairman of Wen Group.

24
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:22,120
Aren't you happy?

25
00:02:22,420 --> 00:02:25,350
Wen Group finally has someone
to carry on the legacy.

26
00:02:27,110 --> 00:02:29,200
Wait. How could I forget?

27
00:02:29,590 --> 00:02:31,190
Your surname isn't even Wen.

28
00:02:31,750 --> 00:02:34,750
Even your name is stolen, Chen Hui.

29
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,100
What right do you have to run Wen Group?

30
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:44,910
You loaf around all day,

31
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:47,520
living in a drunken haze
and throwing your life away.

32
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,780
What right do you have to steal my things?

33
00:02:50,930 --> 00:02:52,860
You really have a bad memory.

34
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:57,150
Didn't you start out by
fawning over customers

35
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:59,280
and entertaining them in dance halls?

36
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:01,960
What? After being Wen Yanhui for decades,

37
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:05,020
do you really think
you're the master of the Wen family?

38
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:08,870
Chen Hui, you can fool others,

39
00:03:08,890 --> 00:03:10,960
but don't fool yourself.

40
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:13,030
You bitch!

41
00:03:13,340 --> 00:03:15,220
I earned Wen Group with my life

42
00:03:15,870 --> 00:03:17,730
I served Wen Yan for so many years.

43
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:19,400
I deserve Wen Group.

44
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:21,680
I had no background and no connections.

45
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,360
I crawled my way out of the mud

46
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:25,310
and made it here step by step.

47
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:27,500
I relied entirely on myself.

48
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,380
You did it all by yourself?

49
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:32,040
The women of the Wen family
were used,

50
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,800
imprisoned, exploited,
and murdered by you.

51
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,030
You got to where you are today

52
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:36,920
relying entirely on women!

53
00:03:36,940 --> 00:03:37,780
Shut up!

54
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:39,630
But the things you stole

55
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:41,720
will never truly be yours.

56
00:03:42,980 --> 00:03:45,980
Chen Hui, no matter how high you climb,

57
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:49,450
you are still a nobody!

58
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,120
My heart.

59
00:03:54,910 --> 00:03:55,800
Dad.

60
00:03:56,710 --> 00:03:57,710
My heart.

61
00:03:58,070 --> 00:03:59,630
Medicine. My medicine.

62
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,360
Medicine.

63
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:04,800
Medicine.

64
00:04:04,890 --> 00:04:06,420
Are you talking about this?

65
00:04:06,820 --> 00:04:07,750
Give it to me.

66
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:09,520
Medicine.

67
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,290
My love

68
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,160
and my child,

69
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:16,079
I beg you to give them back to me.

70
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,490
Can you give them back to me?

71
00:04:21,829 --> 00:04:22,630
My medicine.

72
00:04:22,830 --> 00:04:24,290
Leave the medicine for me.

73
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,240
My medicine.

74
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:35,860
My medicine.

75
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:54,040
I told you,

76
00:04:54,670 --> 00:04:56,630
Wen Group will eventually be mine.

77
00:05:08,310 --> 00:05:09,120
Mom,

78
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:11,040
welcome home.

79
00:05:16,450 --> 00:05:20,010
From now on, we will never be apart again.

80
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,630
I wish we could live like this forever,

81
00:05:57,630 --> 00:05:59,390
happy and at peace.

82
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,930
As long as I'm with you,

83
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,480
I'll be happy no matter what.

84
00:06:27,430 --> 00:06:28,310
This is...

85
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,070
Do you remember?

86
00:06:30,870 --> 00:06:32,330
When you were 16 years old,

87
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:34,020
at the convenience store,

88
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,480
a boy asked you for money.

89
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,630
I need to pay medical bills.

90
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:00,720
My dad is sick.

91
00:07:01,070 --> 00:07:02,480
I need to pay my tuition.

92
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:05,960
It was you?

93
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:09,740
You were the one who was
beaten up at the convenience store?

94
00:07:11,810 --> 00:07:13,320
I will never forget that

95
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:15,020
when I was 16,

96
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:18,750
you pulled me out of the mud,

97
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,450
taught me how to survive,

98
00:07:22,110 --> 00:07:23,910
and gave me the determination to

99
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:25,550
leave that place.

100
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:33,230
When I saw you back then,

101
00:07:35,070 --> 00:07:37,560
although our circumstances were different,

102
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,630
I felt like I was looking at myself.

103
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,270
We were both trapped,

104
00:07:45,850 --> 00:07:47,770
desperately trying to escape.

105
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,180
Open it and take a look.

106
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:22,950
Wen Jianan.

107
00:08:25,930 --> 00:08:27,060
You have always been

108
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:30,660
my one wish.

109
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:34,000
You've been my wish

110
00:08:35,090 --> 00:08:36,250
ever since I was 16.

111
00:08:38,429 --> 00:08:41,230
Although we've already
worn wedding attire once,

112
00:08:41,909 --> 00:08:44,360
the circumstances are different this time.

113
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:48,780
♪ In the darkness
where there is no light ♪

114
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:49,130
We have experienced life-and-death trials

115
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,840
and come to know
how we truly feel about each other.

116
00:08:50,830 --> 00:08:55,830
♪ At the end of every lonely night ♪

117
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:55,510
For you,

118
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:57,030
it might be luck.

119
00:08:57,520 --> 00:09:02,790
♪ Now my heart is beating once again ♪

120
00:08:58,650 --> 00:08:59,770
But for me,

121
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:02,130
it is a great blessing.

122
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:09,480
♪ Finally I'm breathing past the pain ♪

123
00:09:11,250 --> 00:09:14,370
♪ In the winter breeze,
I feel your breath ♪

124
00:09:14,410 --> 00:09:18,100
♪ Waking up my soul from frozen death ♪

125
00:09:16,470 --> 00:09:17,750
Will you marry me?

126
00:09:18,290 --> 00:09:25,340
♪ Like a miracle, you came in view ♪

127
00:09:25,370 --> 00:09:31,950
♪ At the edge of this breaking world ♪

128
00:09:28,450 --> 00:09:29,360
I do.

129
00:09:32,170 --> 00:09:36,190
♪ You are the only one
who brought the light ♪

130
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:39,340
♪ Because it's you ♪

131
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:40,880
♪ All my sorrows ♪

132
00:09:40,950 --> 00:09:46,110
♪ Fading out of sight ♪

133
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:52,340
♪ In your arms, I'm born again and new ♪

134
00:09:53,410 --> 00:09:58,690
♪ Holding tightly to my hands and scars ♪

135
00:10:00,090 --> 00:10:02,510
♪ Your deep breathing ♪

136
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:06,520
♪ Guided like the stars ♪

137
00:10:06,770 --> 00:10:08,970
♪ Now I'll never let you go ♪
